# Negative control for buslogcheck: a well-formed two-cycle log whose end line
# reports one overlap (two accesses pended in one cycle). buslogcheck must fail it.
# buslog v1 fields: seq cycle t14m addr kind value side c14m base wait refresh stretch reasons
case planted_overlap
0 0 0 001000 fetch EA fast 5 5 0 0 0 -
1 1 5 001001 read 11 fast 5 5 0 0 0 -
end planted_overlap runner_cyc=2 clock_c14m=10 dropped=0 overlap=1
